<title>USA: TABLE - United Auto Group sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - United Auto Group sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from United Auto Group Inc was priced Thursday via lead JP Morgan Securities Inc, according to a market source.</p>
<p>United Auto Group, acquires, consolidates and operates automobile dealerships.</p>
<p>BORROWER UNITED AUTO GROUP INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 11.00 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 98.529  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 11.25 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD +506 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
